<title>GABON: SOCCER-GABON AND GHANA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GABON AND GHANA DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LIBREVILLE 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gabon and Ghana drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) on Sunday in their African zone group five World</p>
<p>Cup qualifier.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Gabon -- Theodore Zue N'Guema 65</p>
<p>Ghana -- Abedi Pele 66</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
</text>
